            "body": "Thanks for the suggestion!\r\n\r\nI've thought about doing that, but it seems that utilizing the `NormalNC` highlight group is not only more straightforward but also has better usability in my opinion. So although the colorful separators look great, I don't think they worth extra complexity.\r\n\r\nClosing as not planned.",
